business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ecI3FBTM0f99Fnml3kNKfg","review_id":"yyON2zzEzmBbisLD0b9hEA","date":"2020-06-28T17:45:32","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9565105438232422,"text_excerpt":"New Orleans has plenty of fine cuisine along with colorful personalities, but not everyone can brag about being in business over 100 years... it's a huge accomplishment that Arnaud's should be proud of. I recall the first step into Arnaud's front doors and the entrance has a lovely exterior with iron bars and a mosaic entrance designation \"main entrance\"; step through the doors into a completely different feel but still impressive and lively. White and Red vertical, wide strips from the chair rail up to the ceiling with statues and other nice touches. We had a drink in the bar before our dinner at the French 75 Bar; also a whole different decor and yet it was still unique and comfortable...."},{"business_id":"ecI3FBTM0f99Fnml3kNKfg","review_id":"E5-k0J7b7SAd8ZK2w6mUag","date":"2014-02-06T21:55:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9445489048957825,"text_excerpt":"Great evening! We went to Arnauds for our big dinner out in New Orleans. Loved everything, except the shrimp arnaud. It is their famous dish, so we had to try it for our appetizer, but we just did not like the flavor of the sauce. We got the veal wohl, which was a great dish. It came with small portions of three of their dishes- a veal one with mushroom sauce, crawfish stew, and crab cakes. The crawfish was my favorite, but all were amazing and the variety was great. Dessert was good. We split the chocolate cake and the praline crepes. The chocolate was amazingly decadent and delicious. Crepes had a good praline cream cheese filling, but the actual crepes were a bit disappointing. They se..."},{"business_id":"ecI3FBTM0f99Fnml3kNKfg","review_id":"yCmxCxLdYNZbglSODFFYZQ","date":"2018-06-24T13:28:33","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9439579844474792,"text_excerpt":"I had Arnaud's French 75 Bar listed as a must-visit place in the French Quarter, but didn't realize we could also come for dinner, so we killed two birds with one stone. During my visit in NOLA, Arnaud's was probably my favorite overall experience. Make sure to sit in the jazz bistro! There's a live jazz band playing in the corner who will even come around to your individual table and play some music for a few minutes at a time! Prepare some cash to tip them. They take requests if you have any music in mind. Our server was very kind and got us what we needed. We each ordered French 75's, since that's what Arnaud's is known for, and I ended up ordering a second one since it was so good! I ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ecI3FBTM0f99Fnml3kNKfg","photo_id":"kcYoZ_W-Fe1cfy0aLGBgWQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/kcYoZ_W-Fe1cfy0aLGBgWQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8718152046203613},{"business_id":"ecI3FBTM0f99Fnml3kNKfg","photo_id":"vXVhTyvkh1Xwm97WddXepw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/vXVhTyvkh1Xwm97WddXepw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8664131164550781},{"business_id":"ecI3FBTM0f99Fnml3kNKfg","photo_id":"UgHnOGrwUpH2Xta9XhAY-g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/UgHnOGrwUpH2Xta9XhAY-g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8334660530090332},{"business_id":"ecI3FBTM0f99Fnml3kNKfg","photo_id":"ExiJJ532kKoqvrfJdOhtcw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/ExiJJ532kKoqvrfJdOhtcw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.817782163619